WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 6.3 · MEAL: Monitoring, Evaluation, Accountability & Learning
Indicators

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
An indicator is a clear sign that a result is happening, measured the same way by everyone.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Define who counts, and out of whom, for every percentage.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Plan to break data down from your very first group.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Avoid counting activities as outcomes.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You write an indicator reference sheet for your priority results.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
